      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Focusing exclusively on domestic priorities while ignoring the interconnectedness of our global economy is a fallacy that inevitably leads to short-term political victory at the cost of long-term national decline. Isolationist policies are a dangerous illusion because ideological conflicts, pandemics, and financial crises do not stop at our borders, and history has proven that true peace cannot exist in peace zones left unattended. Therefore, the only sustainable path to enduring domestic prosperity is through active global engagement and the stable economy that foreign aid fosters for all nations.",
